      "description": "Building a Microsoft Fabric data platform from scratch for an enterprise client - connecting SAP, Salesforce, and SQL Server via Data Factory and Dataflows Gen2 with CDC patterns, landing everything into a governed OneLake lakehouse. Set up a medallion architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold) using Spark notebooks and Fabric SQL with data quality checks, schema contracts, and lineage tracking baked in at each layer, not bolted on after. Replaced nightly batch reports with real-time streaming pipelines using Spark Structured Streaming and Fabric Eventstream - records land in Eventhouse KQL…"
