      "is_current": false,
      "date_precision": "month",
      "description": "Migrated a mess of ad hoc SQL scripts and spreadsheet extracts into a proper dbt project on Snowflake standardised models, automated tests, and documentation that actually matched what the data did. Set up Amazon MWAA to replace cron jobs that nobody fully understood - DAGs with retries, proper logging, and enough visibility that the team could tell at a glance what ran and what didn't. Built a predictive maintenance dashboard on real-time IoT data from factory equipment - the kind of thing where a maintenance engineer looks at it in the morning and decides what to check before something…"
    },
