      "description": "Built ELT pipelines on GCP using Cloud Composer and Dataflow to pull sustainability data from facilities across the world, turning what was a manual, multi-week reporting exercise into something that refreshed automatically. Replaced full-load nightly extracts with Debezium CDC pipelines - change events flowing continuously from source systems so the downstream dbt models were always working with fresh data. Wrote the dbt models that standardised CO2 calculations across Scope 1, 2, and 3 globally - same logic, same numbers, auditable - which mattered a lot when regulators and third-party…"
