      "description": "Built QlikSense dashboards that gave supply chain managers an up-to-date view of KPIs across product lines - they had been working off weekly Excel exports, so the reaction to live data was fairly dramatic. Did a root cause analysis on lead time delays using Python and BigQuery, traced the bottlenecks back to specific supplier tiers and logistics routes, and gave procurement something concrete to take into negotiations"
    },
